# The shared base is `defaults, not ie 11`. Opera Mini and KaiOS are excluded
# here for the web bundles: they cannot resolve the surface-scoped custom
# properties the fe design system is built on, so the marketing pages already
# render without their surface colours there, and keeping them as targets only
# costs static fallbacks before every var(), the flattening of logical
# properties to LTR (which forced hand-written RTL twins), and cascade layers.
# The email bundle does not consult this file: it runs no preset-env pass.
extends @ladjs/browserslist-config
not op_mini all
not kaios > 0
